From 7a7fa49e64910a111c14ff89cdcabbc33efc97a3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alex Bee <knaerzche@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 10 Feb 2025 14:21:55 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 16/46] rockchip: rk3128: Add DRAM driver

- based on sdram_rk322x.c
- phy is different
- replaced magic numbers
- removed DM/DT to fit in SRAM
- supports LPDDR2/DDR3 (all types as per DS)
- addtionally set trfc/trefi based on detected cap
- use sdram_common
- set axi priorities as vendor blob does
- provide serveral dram timings to make it "future proof"
  (hopefully nobody will have fiddle to make it still fit in SRAM
   when adding a new board)

Signed-off-by: Alex Bee <knaerzche@gmail.com>
---
 .../include/asm/arch-rockchip/sdram_rk3128.h  | 620 ++++++++++++
 arch/arm/mach-rockchip/Kconfig                |   1 +
 drivers/ram/rockchip/sdram-rk3128-ddr3.inc    |  80 ++
 drivers/ram/rockchip/sdram-rk3128-lpddr2.inc  |  54 ++
 drivers/ram/rockchip/sdram_rk3128.c           | 888 +++++++++++++++++-
 5 files changed, 1641 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 arch/arm/include/asm/arch-rockchip/sdram_rk3128.h
 create mode 100644 drivers/ram/rockchip/sdram-rk3128-ddr3.inc
 create mode 100644 drivers/ram/rockchip/sdram-rk3128-lpddr2.inc

diff --git a/arch/arm/include/asm/arch-rockchip/sdram_rk3128.h b/arch/arm/include/asm/arch-rockchip/sdram_rk3128.h
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000..6a8f9ba550
